**Update**: 

Thanks @davinci1998 for pointing out that we can optimize space complexity to O(1). Here is the optimized version:

```
class Solution {
public:
    int minFlipsMonoIncr(string S) {
        int n = S.size(), prev = 0, cur;

        for(int i=1; i<=n; i++){
            if(S[i-1] == '1')
                cur = prev+1;
            else
                cur = min(prev, i-prev-1);

            prev = cur;
        }

        return prev;
    }
};
```

